    3. Build output table (3n+2 x 3n+2): place 2x2 color headers, fill off-diagonal
       cells with RED or GREY per class membership, leave diagonal as bg.
    4. Build input grid (20-25 x 20-23): place the n oriented masks at random
       non-overlapping positions (all within cols 0..W-2, min gap >= 3).
       Place legend singletons in the last column at rows 0..n-1 in chosen order.
